     "text": "Main deck from Oscar Tan (2002), who prints no sideboard, so sideboard is null. Menendian (2013) prints 1 Annul where Tan has 1 Merchant Scroll, and a sideboard: 4 Hydroblast, 2 Treachery, 2 Tormod's Crypt, 3 Annul, 3 Back to Basics, 1 Disrupt. Neither cites the original forum post.",
